{"product_id":"thomas-jeffersons-feast-step-into-reading-step-4","title":"Thomas Jefferson's Feast (Step into Reading) (Step #4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether they're preparing for President's Day or whether they just like to eat, children will find much to devour in this leveled reader about Thomas Jefferson's role in America's culinary history!Did you know that every time you munch on a french fry or snack on ice cream, you have Thomas Jefferson to thank? It’s true! This founding father was one of America’s first foodies. After a visit to France, he introduced all sorts of yummy treats to America—including one that upset more than just tummies and created a culinary controversy!Get the scoop in this deliciously funny, true story—guaranteed to tempt even the most reluctant readers!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Frank Murphy\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375822896\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738271309977,"sku":"5RD9780375822896","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/ad951e5742ef94fa4a74b724a0c0c9a64cf0bb6b.jpg?v=1758563507","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/thomas-jeffersons-feast-step-into-reading-step-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}